  "components": [
    {
      "name": "Sun Pill (primary)",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-primary",
      "description": "The one thing to press: submits, .primary, add job.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-btn-sun\">Add job</button>",
      "css": ".ds-btn-sun{font:650 14px/1.3 'Plus Jakarta Sans Variable', system-ui, sans-serif;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid var(--sun);background:var(--sun);color:var(--on-sun);cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 140ms ease,border-color 140ms ease,transform 140ms cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)} .ds-btn-sun:hover{background:var(--sun-hover);border-color:var(--sun-hover)} .ds-btn-sun:active{transform:scale(0.97)} .ds-btn-sun:focus-visible{outline:none;box-shadow:var(--focus-ring)} .ds-btn-sun:disabled{background:var(--neutral-bg);color:var(--neutral-fg);border-color:transparent}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Default Button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-default",
      "description": "Ordinary actions on feather mist.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-btn\">Re-evaluate</button>",
      "css": ".ds-btn{font:650 14px/1.3 'Plus Jakarta Sans Variable', system-ui, sans-serif;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid transparent;background:var(--accent-bg);color:var(--accent);cursor:pointer;transition:border-color 140ms ease,transform 140ms cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)} .ds-btn:hover{border-color:var(--accent-border)} .ds-btn:active{transform:scale(0.97)} .ds-btn:focus-visible{outline:none;box-shadow:var(--focus-ring)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Secondary Button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-secondary",
      "description": "Transparent pill with a strong hairline.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-btn-secondary\">Cancel</button>",
      "css": ".ds-btn-secondary{font:650 14px/1.3 'Plus Jakarta Sans Variable', system-ui, sans-serif;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid var(--border-strong);background:transparent;color:var(--text-h);cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 140ms ease,border-color 140ms ease} .ds-btn-secondary:hover{background:var(--hover-tint);border-color:var(--accent-border)} .ds-btn-secondary:focus-visible{outline:none;box-shadow:var(--focus-ring)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Text Input",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "input",
      "description": "Surface field, strong hairline, feather focus.",
      "html": "<input class=\"ds-input\" placeholder=\"Search jobs\">",
      "css": ".ds-input{font:400 14px 'Plus Jakarta Sans Variable', system-ui, sans-serif;padding:7px 11px;color:var(--text-h);background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border-strong);border-radius:10px;transition:border-color 140ms ease,box-shadow 140ms ease} .ds-input:hover{border-color:var(--accent-border)} .ds-input:focus{outline:none;border-color:var(--accent);box-shadow:var(--focus-ring)} .ds-input::placeholder{color:var(--text);opacity:.75}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Side Navigation",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "nav-item",
      "description": "Pill nav items under labelled sections; the current page is a bookmark in the page colour running flush into the page; the sun counter carries the magpie head for new jobs.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\"><a class=\"ds-nav-item ds-active\" href=\"#\">Dashboard</a><a class=\"ds-nav-item\" href=\"#\">Jobs<span class=\"ds-pill ds-finds\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"13\" r=\"8\" fill=\"var(--mag-ink)\"/><circle cx=\"15\" cy=\"16\" r=\"4\" fill=\"var(--mag-white)\"/><circle cx=\"13\" cy=\"11\" r=\"1.4\" fill=\"var(--mag-white)\"/><path d=\"M19 12l4 1.5-4 1.5z\" fill=\"var(--mag-ink)\"/></svg>12</span></a><a class=\"ds-nav-item\" href=\"#\">Applications<span class=\"ds-pill\">4</span></a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{display:grid;gap:2px;width:236px;padding:12px;background:var(--sidebar);border-radius:16px} .ds-nav-item{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:13px;height:40px;padding:0 14px;border-radius:999px;color:var(--text-h);font:550 14px/1.3 'Plus Jakarta Sans Variable', system-ui, sans-serif;text-decoration:none;transition:background-color 140ms ease} .ds-nav-item:hover{background:var(--hover-tint)} .ds-nav-item.ds-active{background:var(--canvas);color:var(--accent);font-weight:700;margin-right:-12px;border-radius:999px 0 0 999px} .ds-nav-item:focus-visible{outline:none;box-shadow:var(--focus-ring)} .ds-pill{margin-left:auto;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:2px;height:22px;min-width:22px;padding:0 8px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--accent-bg);color:var(--accent);font:750 12px/1 'Plus Jakarta Sans Variable', system-ui, sans-serif;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums} .ds-pill.ds-finds{padding-left:3px;background:var(--sun);color:var(--on-sun)} .ds-pill.ds-finds svg{margin-top:-3px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Segmented Control",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "segmented-tab-active",
      "description": "Pill tray; feather fill marks the active tab.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-seg\"><button class=\"ds-tab ds-on\">Pending</button><button class=\"ds-tab\">Offers</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-seg{display:inline-flex;gap:2px;padding:3px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border)} .ds-tab{font:650 13.5px/1.3 'Plus Jakarta Sans Variable', system-ui, sans-serif;padding:6px 16px;border:0;border-radius:999px;background:transparent;color:var(--text);cursor:pointer} .ds-tab:hover{background:var(--hover-tint);color:var(--text-h)} .ds-tab.ds-on{background:var(--accent-fill);color:var(--on-accent-fill)} .ds-tab:focus-visible{outline:none;box-shadow:var(--focus-ring)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Status Badges",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "card",
      "description": "Tinted pairs for status.",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-badge ds-ok\">Offer</span> <span class=\"ds-badge ds-warn\">Due</span> <span class=\"ds-badge ds-bad\">Rejected</span> <span class=\"ds-badge\">Draft</span>",
      "css": ".ds-badge{display:inline-flex;padding:2px 10px;border-radius:999px;font:600 12.5px/1.5 'Plus Jakarta Sans Variable', system-ui, sans-serif;background:var(--neutral-bg);color:var(--text-h)} .ds-ok{background:var(--success-bg);color:var(--success-fg)} .ds-warn{background:var(--warn-bg);color:var(--warn-fg)} .ds-bad{background:var(--danger-bg);color:var(--danger-fg)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Stat Band",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "stat-tile",
      "description": "Signature: tonal tiles with display numerals; the sun tile carries the magpie when jobs await review.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-stats\"><a class=\"ds-tile ds-sun\" href=\"#\"><svg width=\"30\" height=\"30\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"13\" r=\"8\" fill=\"var(--mag-ink)\"/><circle cx=\"15\" cy=\"16\" r=\"4\" fill=\"var(--mag-white)\"/><circle cx=\"13\" cy=\"11\" r=\"1.4\" fill=\"var(--mag-white)\"/><path d=\"M19 12l4 1.5-4 1.5z\" fill=\"var(--mag-ink)\"/></svg><span class=\"ds-val\">12</span><span class=\"ds-lab\">Jobs to review</span></a><a class=\"ds-tile\" href=\"#\"><span class=\"ds-val\">7</span><span class=\"ds-lab\">Active applications</span></a><div class=\"ds-tile\"><span class=\"ds-val\">38%</span><span class=\"ds-lab\">Response rate</span></div></section>",
      "css": ".ds-stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(150px,1fr));gap:3px;border-radius:24px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--canvas)} .ds-tile{position:relative;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;min-height:118px;padding:18px 20px 16px;background:var(--surface);border-radius:6px;color:inherit;text-decoration:none;transition:background-color 140ms ease} a.ds-tile:hover{background:var(--surface-2)} a.ds-tile:focus-visible{outline:none;box-shadow:inset var(--focus-ring)} .ds-tile svg{position:absolute;top:14px;right:14px} .ds-val{margin-top:auto;font:760 46px/1 'Bricolage Grotesque Variable', 'Plus Jakarta Sans Variable', system-ui, sans-serif;letter-spacing:-0.04em;color:var(--text-h);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums} .ds-lab{font:600 13.5px 'Plus Jakarta Sans Variable', system-ui, sans-serif;color:var(--text)} .ds-sun{background:var(--sun)} .ds-sun:hover{background:var(--sun-hover)} .ds-sun .ds-val,.ds-sun .ds-lab{color:var(--on-sun)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Profile Card",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "profile-card",
      "description": "Sidebar card with a feather-mist avatar and Bricolage name.",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-profile\" href=\"#\"><span class=\"ds-avatar\">AK</span><span class=\"ds-pname\">Anna<br><span>Kowalska</span></span></a>",
      "css": ".ds-profile{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:13px;width:236px;min-height:96px;padding:14px 12px;box-sizing:border-box;border-radius:24px;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid transparent;text-decoration:none;transition:border-color 140ms ease} .ds-profile:hover{border-color:var(--accent-border)} .ds-profile:focus-visible{outline:none;box-shadow:var(--focus-ring)} .ds-avatar{display:grid;place-items:center;width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--accent-bg);color:var(--accent);font:800 19px 'Bricolage Grotesque Variable', 'Plus Jakarta Sans Variable', system-ui, sans-serif;letter-spacing:-0.03em} .ds-pname{font:760 19px/1.08 'Bricolage Grotesque Variable', 'Plus Jakarta Sans Variable', system-ui, sans-serif;letter-spacing:-0.025em;color:var(--text-h)} .ds-pname span{font-weight:450}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Brand Mark",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "brand-sun",
      "description": "The magpie head against a sun disc, with the Bricolage wordmark.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-brand\"><span class=\"ds-disc\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"13\" r=\"8\" fill=\"var(--mag-ink)\"/><circle cx=\"15\" cy=\"16\" r=\"4\" fill=\"var(--mag-white)\"/><circle cx=\"13\" cy=\"11\" r=\"1.4\" fill=\"var(--mag-white)\"/><path d=\"M19 12l4 1.5-4 1.5z\" fill=\"var(--mag-ink)\"/></svg></span><span class=\"ds-word\">Pica</span></div>",
      "css": ".ds-brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;color:var(--text-h)} .ds-disc{display:grid;place-items:center;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--sun);overflow:hidden} .ds-disc svg{margin:4px 0 0 -2px} .ds-word{font:800 23px/1 'Bricolage Grotesque Variable', 'Plus Jakarta Sans Variable', system-ui, sans-serif;letter-spacing:-0.04em}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Magpie at Golden Hour",
    "overview": "**Creative North Star: \"The Magpie at Golden Hour\"**\n\nPica is a flat, saturated field of colour, lit like the sky at either end of the day. Sunrise (light) is a pale dawn lilac with indigo ink. Sunset (dark) is an ink-violet ground with plum surfaces and lavender text. Two lights cross that field. Sun yellow marks what to press and what is new. Iridescent feather blue, taken from the magpie's wing, marks where you are.\n\nIt is an operate-mode app shell, dense and calm. The world is carried by type, palette, density and one signature move, not by decoration. Headings and big numbers are set in heavy Bricolage Grotesque, so the page reads as confident and a little playful. Every control is a pill and every container is a generously curved rectangle. Depth comes only from tone steps: canvas, sidebar, surface and surface-2 sit at different lightnesses and do the work a shadow would do elsewhere. Hairlines appear only where tone alone cannot separate two things.\n\nThe magpie is the brand. It appears as a head against a sun disc in the brand mark, it peeks out of the sun-yellow new-jobs counter and the sun stat tile wherever something shiny has arrived, and it sits on a pale feather stage as the worker-status character and in empty states. There are no forest, landscape or scenery motifs. The golden-hour idea lives entirely in the palette.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Flat by rule: every shadow token is `none`; depth is tone.",
      "Two lights: sun yellow for action and novelty, feather blue for location and focus.",
      "Heavy grotesque display type over a friendly humanist sans UI.",
      "Pills for actions, curved rectangles (10 / 16 / 24px) for containers.",
      "The magpie head beside anything new.",
      "Two themes, Sunrise and Sunset, with the same roles and different lightness."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Two Lights Rule",
        "body": "Sun yellow means \"press this\" or \"this is new\"; feather blue means \"you are here\". A colour never borrows the other's job: a current page is never yellow, a primary action is never blue.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The One Sun Rule",
        "body": "Each page header or toolbar carries at most one sun pill. Everything else is a feather-mist default pill or a transparent secondary pill.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Sun Ink Rule",
        "body": "Text and icons on sun are `on-sun` dark ink, in both themes.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Heavy Ink Rule",
        "body": "Bricolage Grotesque is for headings, display numbers, the wordmark and the profile name only. UI text, labels and controls stay in Plus Jakarta Sans.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
